[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 540.63, "timestamp": "00:09:00", "text": "当前时间和预定流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 543.829, "timestamp": "00:09:03", "text": "Unix格式的时间。正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 547.03, "timestamp": "00:09:07", "text": "所以我们答对了一个数字，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 549.829, "timestamp": "00:09:09", "text": "以毫秒为单位，也就是秒或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 551.99, "timestamp": "00:09:11", "text": "毫秒或者其他什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 555.829, "timestamp": "00:09:15", "text": "没错，我们正在为我们的……做这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 559.35, "timestamp": "00:09:19", "text": "活动没有直播播报员之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 563.269, "timestamp": "00:09:23", "text": "我已经有了，所以我可以直接复制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 566.949, "timestamp": "00:09:26", "text": "照着做就行了[倒吸一口凉气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 569.85, "timestamp": "00:09:29", "text": "我可以直接复制粘贴吗？我觉得可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 572.47, "timestamp": "00:09:32", "text": "[音乐] 喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 574.71, "timestamp": "00:09:34", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 578.15, "timestamp": "00:09:38", "text": "我可以直接复制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.07, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "所以，是的，我们会有一个运行按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 588.47, "timestamp": "00:09:48", "text": "也。我不得不把这一切都清理干净。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 590.31, "timestamp": "00:09:50", "text": "甲板，伙计。这是什么？太[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 595.59, "timestamp": "00:09:55", "text": "太多太多东西了。 [倒吸一口气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 599.91, "timestamp": "00:09:59", "text": "空白按钮太多了。"}]